    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHAT IS IT?</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Take command of a scrappy starship </strong>and become the ultimate arm-chair space ship captain in Frontiers Reach : Battlespace! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/0140e4db3104e77bbf1184059ca1b7b5.poster.avif?t=1751540041\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/0140e4db3104e77bbf1184059ca1b7b5.webm?t=1751540041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/0140e4db3104e77bbf1184059ca1b7b5.mp4?t=1751540041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Frontiers Reach : Battlespace is a low stress management/idle game set in the Frontiers Reach Universe. Where in FR1 you took on the role of a pilot fighting in a desperate bid to escape an interstellar war, here you'll take command of a carrier and participate directly in the fight for control of planets in the frontier worlds. <br> <br>You'll start with next to nothing as your carrier sits in orbit around the moon Frontiers Reach. Completing objectives in support of friendly forces in the battlespace is how you'll progress. As you earn doubloons you'll have the ability to spend them to incrementally increase your vessels capabilities and add new functionality until your carrier is a hulking war machine hopping from one battlespace to the next to deal out damage to enemy forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/98fa23e25b93ec4dd94f598990da689c.poster.avif?t=1751540041\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/98fa23e25b93ec4dd94f598990da689c.webm?t=1751540041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/98fa23e25b93ec4dd94f598990da689c.mp4?t=1751540041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POINT &amp; CLICK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At its core FR : Battlespace is a relaxed experience</strong> and only requires the use of a mouse to play; mixing idle and management gameplay elements to bring you a space game you play with the flick of a wrist.<br><br><br><strong>EXPANDING TECH TREE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With a host of technologies to start and more to be added later</strong>, you'll have plenty of room to build up your starship from it's humble beginnings into a formidable platform for dealing damage in the war for the Frontier Worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/4fc2e819f8bb93848228b84461033224.poster.avif?t=1751540041\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/4fc2e819f8bb93848228b84461033224.webm?t=1751540041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/4fc2e819f8bb93848228b84461033224.mp4?t=1751540041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHIP CUSTOMIZATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your starship with a growing selection of options!\u00a0</strong>From color schemes to logos and even the ability to name your ship. The options will continue to grow from here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/00b8eb02a15d4d072bcd94e4f5a259a3.poster.avif?t=1751540041\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/00b8eb02a15d4d072bcd94e4f5a259a3.webm?t=1751540041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/00b8eb02a15d4d072bcd94e4f5a259a3.mp4?t=1751540041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A NEW UNIVERSE TO EXPLORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you've never before set foot into the Frontiers Reach Universe</strong>, then Frontiers Reach : Battlespace is a great way to get started! I'm still hammering out the details of the story but a small selection of what will eventually be a number of locations is already in and ready for play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/8bd80eaf7b7139b2f408582500b5afd5.poster.avif?t=1751540041\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/8bd80eaf7b7139b2f408582500b5afd5.webm?t=1751540041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/8bd80eaf7b7139b2f408582500b5afd5.mp4?t=1751540041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHAT IS IT?</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Take command of a scrappy starship </strong>and become the ultimate arm-chair space ship captain in Frontiers Reach : Battlespace! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/0140e4db3104e77bbf1184059ca1b7b5.poster.avif?t=1751540041\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/0140e4db3104e77bbf1184059ca1b7b5.webm?t=1751540041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/0140e4db3104e77bbf1184059ca1b7b5.mp4?t=1751540041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Frontiers Reach : Battlespace is a low stress management/idle game set in the Frontiers Reach Universe. Where in FR1 you took on the role of a pilot fighting in a desperate bid to escape an interstellar war, here you'll take command of a carrier and participate directly in the fight for control of planets in the frontier worlds. <br> <br>You'll start with next to nothing as your carrier sits in orbit around the moon Frontiers Reach. Completing objectives in support of friendly forces in the battlespace is how you'll progress. As you earn doubloons you'll have the ability to spend them to incrementally increase your vessels capabilities and add new functionality until your carrier is a hulking war machine hopping from one battlespace to the next to deal out damage to enemy forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/98fa23e25b93ec4dd94f598990da689c.poster.avif?t=1751540041\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co