=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/00b8eb02a15d4d072bcd94e4f5a259a3.poster.avif?t=1751540041\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/00b8eb02a15d4d072bcd94e4f5a259a3.webm?t=1751540041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/00b8eb02a15d4d072bcd94e4f5a259a3.mp4?t=1751540041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A NEW UNIVERSE TO EXPLORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you've never before set foot into the Frontiers Reach Universe</strong>, then Frontiers Reach : Battlespace is a great way to get started! I'm still hammering out the details of the story but a small selection of what will eventually be a number of locations is already in and ready for play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/8bd80eaf7b7139b2f408582500b5afd5.poster.avif?t=1751540041\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/8bd80eaf7b7139b2f408582500b5afd5.webm?t=1751540041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526810/extras/8bd80eaf7b7139b2f408582500b5afd5.mp4?t=1751540041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
